		<text id="0" type="text/markdown" rect="(700.0, 300.0, 330.0, 120.0)" font-family="Sans Serif" font-size="16">*Chapter 12. In each Corpus, set the text feature: `Content` (12A, 12C), `Title` (12B), `Review` (12D). Color t-SNE by `category` or `Sentiment`. 12C: select a row in the Data Table.*</text>
